  "en": "Touya: Your imagination. Just your imagination. More importantly...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1896,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce412:0078D",
  "jp": "ヤマト「あっ、止まった」",
