  "en": "Touya: 'Like what?'",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 7059,
  "text_len": 19
 },
 {
  "id": "sce412:01BAA",
  "jp": "ヤマト『まったく！　ユミールも困ってるでしょ⁈』",
  "off": 7082,
  "len": 31,
  "en": "Yamato: 'Honestly! Can't you see Ymir doesn't know what to do either!?'",
